  "explanation": "A centromeric probe reports chromosome copy number. Three CEP 21 signals in a scorable nucleus correspond to three copies of chromosome 21. Overlapping nuclei are excluded before percentages are calculated. The 60% teaching cutoff belongs to this case file and is not a laboratory-wide rule.",
